      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your reflection on the vastness of the universe is a profound and ancient question that has stirred human contemplation for millennia. Many find that recognizing our insignificance doesn't make life pointless, but rather liberates us to find extraordinary meaning in our small, fleeting existence. The science communicates precisely what you saw: we are a universe made of stars and galaxies that include us all.",
      "source": "target",
