      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your struggle highlights a very real and comforting paradox: the universe is indifferent, which allows us to choose whether our lives have meaning without external mandates. Because there is no god or grand design enforcing purpose, the freedom to find genuine connection and joy becomes infinitely more powerful and authentic. We aren't deluding ourselves; we are the universe experiencing itself, and those fleeting moments of awareness are the only \"points\" that exist.",
      "source": "target",
